## Provenance item to resolve before a public release

flasher/Sources/ESPFlashGUI/Resources/ESP32Board.usdz is a Blender conversion of
the SolidWorks assembly that used to live in flasher/3d/. That CAD source had
no recorded license or download provenance, which is why it is no longer in
this repository, and the derived USDZ is still shipped inside the macOS app.
Either confirm redistribution rights for that model or replace the 3D board
preview with one you own before publishing release binaries.
